// Bun Snapshot v1, https://bun.sh/docs/test/snapshots

exports[`help-surface snapshots HelpOverview(registry, 'mainx') 1`] = `
"prx
==========

Work-unit identity: GH-NNN (for example GH-456). GitHub issue identity is canonical.

Primary workflow:
  prx plan session  Open plan-mode work session for a unit
  prx next          Show next recommended action
  prx do            Execute an enabled derived action
  prx plan handoff  Post-merge handoff from feature worktree

Pointers:
  prx help-all              Full command sitemap, grouped by domain
  prx <cmd> --help          Flags and full semantics for one command"
`;

exports[`help-surface snapshots HelpAll(registry) 1`] = `
"prx — full command catalog
==========================

State:
  prx model show                Print machine model summary
  prx model actors              List actors in the workflow model
  prx model graph               Emit machine graph in chosen format
  prx model stately             Open machine in Stately registry
  prx chain status              Show parity chain status across repos
  prx chain check               Run parity check for a unit
  prx chain check-issue         Check issue parity for a unit
  prx chain check-session       Check session parity for a unit
  prx chain prune               Prune stale parity chain leaves
  prx gc                        Reclaim and reconcile housekeeping across the system
  prx gc inventory              Discover reclaimable housekeeping items without mutating anything
  prx gc run                    Sweep reclaimable items (dry-run by default; --apply acts)
  prx gc teardown               Fully tear down a named work-unit (acts by default)
  prx chain backfill            Backfill missing parity chain entries
  prx chain sync                Sync parity chain across authorities
  prx contract show             Show current PR contract content
  prx contract init             Initialize a new PR contract
  prx contract status           Show PR contract status
  prx contract transition       Transition the PR contract state
  prx contract event            Emit an event onto the contract
  prx contract skills           List skills enabled by the contract
  prx contract open-mode        Show or compute open-mode for contract
  prx contract update           Update PR contract from current state
  prx scout comments            Fetch PR review comments and threads
  prx scout ci                  Fetch remote CI status for a PR
  prx scout checks              Fetch repo check configuration
  prx scout logs                Fetch CI logs for a PR
  prx scout status              Fetch repo and worktree status
  prx scout overview            Fetch a repo overview snapshot
  prx scout source              Resolve a work unit's source authority (GH/beads/Notion)
  prx spawn                     Signed SLSA spawn attestations — the ocap that gates leg launches
  prx spawn verify              Verify a leg's signed SLSA spawn attestation (signature + material)
  prx derive                    Query Datalog-derived facts over projected state
  prx derive ready              List ready units via the readiness rules
  prx derive drift              List drifted chains and the violated invariant
  prx derive eligible           List actors eligible to act on an issue
  prx derive why                Print the provenance tree for a derived fact
  prx derive dump-facts         Emit projected and derived facts as JSONL
  prx fetch                     Refresh substrate from external sources
  prx fetch gh-issues           Project a GH-issues refresh cost; --dry-run only in spike
  prx doctor gh-budget          Summarize recent gh GraphQL spend by verb
  prx provenance                Inspect provenance signing identities (read-only)
  prx provenance dev-pubkey     Print the persisted dev signing identity
  prx provenance commit-pubkey  Print prx's commit-signing public key to register with GitHub
  prx audit                     Measure architectural adherence across artifact graph
  prx audit ingest              Refresh metrics store from audit sink and transitions
  prx audit system              Roll up seven V1 metrics across the artifact graph
  prx services                  Inspect external service planes (Anthropic, …)
  prx services status           Project cache hit rate from non-interactive-agent usage rows
  prx dep                       Periodically research upstream deps
  prx dep manifest              Print resolved dep-research manifest
  prx dep research              Snapshot upstream dep paths into .prx/dep-research/
  prx dep status                Inspect last-run + classification per dep (read-only)
  prx sync                      Canonical actor surface for issue reconcile
  prx sync issues               Reconcile pinned pairs; --limit caps push only
  prx sync backfill             Backfill cursor-skipped external records over a range
  prx sync serve                Run the sync agent: periodic cross-repo reconcile daemon
  prx memory compact            Compact closed beads (memory-decay policy chokepoint)
  prx handoff enqueue           Enqueue a handoff for the recipient actor
  prx handoff status            Show pending handoffs filtered by target
  prx handoff drain             Drain pending handoffs for one recipient
  prx handoff replay            Re-enqueue an abandoned or failed row
  prx transcripts digest        Digest transcripts into durable memory shards
  prx transcripts status        Report transcript TTL pressure and candidates

Work units:
  prx plan session          Open plan-mode work session for a unit
  prx next                  Show next recommended action
  prx do                    Execute an enabled derived action
  prx intake agent          Run the mainx intake operator (headless by default, --interactive for PTY)
  prx triage agent          Run the mainx triage operator (headless by default, --interactive for PTY)
  prx submit agent          Run the work-unit submit operator (headless by default, --interactive for PTY)
  prx implement agent       Open implement-mode work session for a unit
  prx author agent          Run the work-unit PR author (headless by default, --interactive for PTY)
  prx author body-template  Render PR body from plan and diff
  prx scratch               Open safe-by-default ad-hoc Claude session (--unsafe for ambient authority)
  prx claude                Internal claude runtime launcher (formerly session open-claude)
  prx plan handoff          Post-merge handoff from feature worktree
  prx plan close            Close work unit issue with operator context
  prx plan ci               Run canonical pre-push validation locally
  prx plan status           Show current phase for the unit
  prx plan next             Show next recommended action
  prx plan prime            Pre-stage worktree rebase and hydrate
  prx plan save             Persist a plan blob (see plan show --paths for location)
  prx plan load             Load a plan blob from the CAS plan store
  prx plan show             Show plan blob; --slot pins, default approved with draft fallback
  prx plan view             View an issue (GH/bd/Notion id, URL)
  prx plan search           Search GH+bd issue queue (deduped)
  prx plan preflight        Pre-draft three-axis check before a plan session
  prx ci                    Run canonical pre-push validation locally
  prx phase                 Show current phase for the unit
  prx snapshot              Emit full session snapshot json
  prx statusline            Emit single-line statusline projection
  prx actions               List suggested actions for the unit
  prx intake spike          File an intake-log spike issue
  prx intake decision       File an intake-log design-decision issue
  prx intake bug            File an intake-log bug issue
  prx intake task           File an intake-log task issue
  prx intake feature        File an intake-log feature issue
  prx intake view           View an issue (GH/bd/Notion id, URL)
  prx intake search         Unified GH+bd dedupe search before filing
  prx intake merge          Pointer comment + close (atomic dedupe)
  prx intake comment        Pointer comment without close
  prx intake source         Pin a work unit's source authority as <unit>:source@pinned
  prx triage status         List untriaged issues, reverse orphans, drift, stale beads; closed-as-dup excluded (GH-1829)
  prx triage classify       Classify open issues by axis
  prx triage apply          Apply classifier output to GitHub labels
  prx triage type-pass      Bulk-classify type-less issues via Haiku
  prx triage close          Close a bd-only record (no GH mirror)
  prx triage prime          Drive the untriaged count toward 0
  prx map create            Capture a named cross-tree initiative as a map
  prx map show              Render a stored map's sequence and rationale
  prx doctor                Diagnose PR readiness, drive guarded transitions
  prx doctor inventory      Print typed PR snapshot with gate breakdown
  prx publisher             Drive PR publication transitions through GitHub
  prx publisher merge       Gate against I04, then enable automerge
  prx publisher ready       Gate ci+threads, then mark PR ready for review
  prx publisher draft       Convert PR back to draft (no gate)
  prx publisher pr          Forge PR open update comment and edit verbs
  prx publisher pr open     Open a PR (gh pr create), draft by default
  prx publisher pr update   Update-branch (rebase onto base) and optionally retitle
  prx publisher pr comment  Post a review comment on the PR
  prx publisher pr edit     Edit the PR title or body
  prx keeper                Git-write and ref custody for a work unit
  prx keeper push           Push the work-unit branch to its remote (keeper role)
  prx keeper branch         Create or update the work-unit branch ref (keeper role)
  prx keeper commit         Headlessly stage and commit the worktree (keeper role; GH-2346)
  prx builder               Manage the nix remote builder (a pinned podman container, prx-zj8)
  prx builder up            Run the nix-builder container (sshd + nix) for remote builds
  prx builder register      Print the /etc/nix/machines line + ssh config to register the builder
  prx audit uow             Project per-UoW artifact chain and invariant findings
  prx scope-gate            Gate a commit's diff against the plan's declared scope
  prx scope-gate run        Check files_changed ⊆ plan.paths; emit a signed gate/v1 verdict
  prx test-gate             Run the checks the executor skipped, as a signed gate
  prx test-gate run         Run typecheck + test on the commit; emit a signed gate/v1 verdict
  prx submit body-template  Render PR body with Closes/Refs lines per unit
  prx submit postmerge      Sweep merged PR body, close referenced units missed
  prx submit stage          Stage git state into a CAS submit artifact (publish producer)
  prx submit publish        Publish a CAS-backed submit artifact (push + gh pr create)
  prx delegate assign       Assign a work unit to an agent (bd-canonical; mirror projects to GH)

Repo plumbing:
  prx repo add               Clone bare repo and bootstrap detached mainx
  prx repo adopt             Adopt on-disk worktree into prx registry
  prx repo convert-to-bare   Convert a standard working copy to bare + linked worktree
  prx branch adopt           Adopt current branch into prx registry
  prx workspace adopt        Adopt on-disk worktree into prx registry
  prx workspace reserve      Reserve a workspace branch (idempotent ensure-branch)
  prx workspace materialize  Materialize the reserved workspace worktree on disk
  prx workspace prepare      Prepare workspace tooling files for a lifecycle phase
  prx workspace sync         Idempotently re-apply workspace tooling-file drift correction
  prx workspace service      Start or stop workspace compose services (--auto = no-op without profile)
  prx workspace teardown     Mark the workspace torn down (closes lifecycle ledger)
  prx repo backfill          Populate bd_workspace_prefix on stale inventory entries (GH-1722)
  prx repo add-dolthub       Wire a Dolthub remote on a per-project beads workspace (GH-1703)
  prx repo bootstrap         Bootstrap per-project .beads/ and wire Dolthub on a beads-less repo (GH-1704)
  prx repo list              List prx-managed repositories across hosts
  prx repo local             List repos cloned under HOME
  prx repo normalize         Normalize repo names against canonical config
  prx repo materialize       Clone or fetch a registered bare repo idempotently
  prx repo overview          Print repo overview snapshot (accepts optional <slug> positional; falls back to cwd)
  prx repo status            Print repo status with git details
  prx repo checks            Show repo branch protection checks
  prx repo sync-issues       Sync repo issue state from GitHub
  prx repo sync-status       Sync repo status state from GitHub
  prx repo protect-main      Apply branch protection to main
  prx repo ci                Fetch remote CI summary for a PR
  prx repo pr-comments       List or resolve PR review threads
  prx repo set               Set a per-repo axis (canonical, stale-threshold-days, bd-workspace-prefix, dolt-remote)
  prx worktree list          List worktrees with status flags
  prx worktree status        Show single worktree status
  prx worktree remove        Remove a worktree and branch
  prx worktree refresh       Rebase work-unit branch onto origin main
  prx tools git              Wrap git with policy enforcement
  prx dolt provision         Provision per-repo dolt database and initial push (GH-1685)
  prx dolt start             Start prx-owned dolt sql-server for this repo
  prx dolt stop              Stop prx-owned dolt sql-server for this repo
  prx dolt status            Report dolt sql-server lifecycle and health
  prx dolt adopt             Adopt an external dolt sql-server pid (legacy import)
  prx dolt reconcile         Reconcile dolt push, optionally resolving schema conflicts
  prx dolt sync-all          Fan-out reconcile over every managed dolt database (GH-1702)
  prx dolt policy            Set dolt.auto-push or dolt.auto-commit across managed workspaces
  prx dolt supervise         Enable cross-session dolt supervisor (Darwin launchd, GH-568)
  prx mediator detect        Detect conflicted paths in an in-progress rebase
  prx mediator classify      Classify each detected merge conflict by kind
  prx mediator status        Report the merge-conflict reconciliation lifecycle state

System:
  prx rules render              Render claude/rules/*.md from typed inputs
  prx rules validate            Validate rules markdown against typed substrate
  prx rules inputs              Dump typed inputs as JSON for debugging
  prx transcripts list-sources  List registered transcript source adapters
  prx hooks apply               Apply prx-managed git hooks across repos
  prx hooks status              Report git hooks path drift
  prx preflight claude          Verify claude agent runtime dependencies
  prx preflight notion          Verify notion MCP runtime dependencies
  prx capabilities              Report available capabilities and how to enable them
  prx run profile               Print runtime profile projection
  prx run smoke                 Smoke-test agent runtime for a unit
  prx run desktop               Open worktree in Codex Desktop
  prx run task                  Run a task spec across roles
  prx init                      Scaffold cross-agent convention layer (AGENTS.md + project Claude settings)
  prx --version                 Print prx CLI version

Deprecated spellings:
  prx open — alias for \`prx plan session\`; removal: #582 / #833
  prx work — alias for \`prx plan session\`; removal: #582
  prx implement session — alias for \`prx implement agent\`; removal: GH-1242 PR-5
  prx doctor merge — alias for \`prx publisher merge\`; removal: GH-1398 publisher chain (#6)
  prx doctor ready — alias for \`prx publisher ready\`; removal: GH-1398 publisher chain (#6)
  prx doctor draft — alias for \`prx publisher draft\`; removal: GH-1398 publisher chain (#6)

Common flow:
  prx contract init
  prx plan session GH-<n>
  prx chain status --remote && prx session next
  prx contract update --apply

Work-unit identity:
  Canonical IDs use GH-NNN format (for example GH-456).
  GitHub issue identity is canonical; ticket/unit/worktree/PR projections share it."
`;
